[Expected Approach] Using Two Pointers - O(n) Time and O(1) SpaceThe idea is to use two pointers (both begin from left side): one to keep track of  policemen and the other for thieves. We traverse the array while maintaining these pointers. If a policeman and a thief are within the allowed range k, the thief is caught, and both pointers move forward. If the thief is too far left, we move the thief pointer forward otherwise policeman is too far left, we move the policeman pointer forward.
